# NOT src/generated - Prisma 7.9.1's client generator has a Windows-vs-Linux
# bug: on Linux it writes a bad "./internal/class.ts" import (should be
# .js), which crashes the container at startup. Building on Windows
# produces the correct output, so we ship that instead of letting the
# container regenerate it fresh. Re-run `npx prisma generate` on the host
# after any schema.prisma change, before rebuilding the image.
